<title>USA: UBS Securities hires three equity analysts.</title>
<headline>UBS Securities hires three equity analysts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland's UBS Securities LLC said Friday it hired three analysts who cover the Internet, computer services and oil services industries.</p>
<p>-- Jonathan Cohen, formerly of Smith Barney, will cover Internet companies.</p>
<p>-- Moshe Katri, formerly of Oppenheimer, to cover the computer services industry.</p>
<p>-- Wesley Maat, formerly of NatWest, to cover the oil services industry.</p>
